WEBVTT

01:30.320 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:52.000 --> 01:52.840
Halt.

01:57.080 --> 01:58.440
Sir, we've arrived.

02:00.360 --> 02:02.360
But why have you come here?

02:04.160 --> 02:05.520
Last year, I once cast a fortune.

02:05.600 --> 02:08.560
It foretold that today,
I would reunite with an old friend here.

02:08.639 --> 02:11.320
But I don't know
if she still remembers me.

02:32.040 --> 02:33.280
Xie Xuechen,

02:34.120 --> 02:36.000
are you leaving me here
to roast like meat?

02:38.880 --> 02:41.240
I must find someone to help Miss Mu.

02:50.960 --> 02:51.800
Miss Mu!

02:51.880 --> 02:53.080
-I found the smartest person
-Bao…

02:53.160 --> 02:55.840
in the entire world to save you!

02:56.760 --> 03:00.400
In your eyes, it seems everyone is smart.

03:01.680 --> 03:02.720
Shackle of Delicacy…

03:10.480 --> 03:11.880
You recognize this array?

03:11.960 --> 03:14.400
The Shackle of Delicacy
binds but does not kill.

03:14.480 --> 03:15.920
It is an array of mercy.

03:16.720 --> 03:17.800
Mercy?

03:17.880 --> 03:19.440
This array is forged with blood.

03:19.520 --> 03:20.680
Its faint golden light suggests

03:20.760 --> 03:23.360
the creator possesses immense power.

03:23.440 --> 03:26.120
If one intended to kill, why use an array?

03:26.200 --> 03:28.600
If one intended to create an array,
why use blood?

03:29.600 --> 03:31.440
It seems the creator
must be in a terrible situation,

03:31.520 --> 03:33.680
forced to use a desperate measure
against his enemy.

03:33.760 --> 03:35.720
Miss, you must be extraordinary.

03:37.400 --> 03:39.200
Indeed, that's a clever one.

03:41.560 --> 03:43.400
Sir, please help her.

03:44.200 --> 03:45.920
Miss Mu is a good person.

03:46.440 --> 03:50.280
She had a fight with her friend,
so she's trapped here.

03:50.800 --> 03:51.920
If you help her,

03:52.000 --> 03:55.080
I'll share half of my treasures with you.

03:56.880 --> 03:57.960
Alright.

03:58.640 --> 03:59.720
May I ask, miss,

04:00.320 --> 04:02.560
why did your friend trap you here?

04:03.840 --> 04:05.440
I once saved him,

04:06.320 --> 04:08.840
risking my life to pull him out of danger.

04:10.200 --> 04:11.560
Afterward,

04:11.640 --> 04:14.680
we fought the enemy together,
advancing and retreating as one,

04:14.760 --> 04:16.160
and narrowly escaped death many times.

04:17.920 --> 04:19.040
But I never expected

04:19.120 --> 04:21.920
that over a small misunderstanding,
he would accuse me of harming someone

04:24.000 --> 04:25.000
and take such cruel action against me.

04:26.640 --> 04:28.000
Sir, do you not believe me?

04:28.520 --> 04:29.920
Not at all.

04:30.000 --> 04:32.400
If you say so, then I shall believe you.

04:34.640 --> 04:36.760
Would you be willing
to provide some guidance?

04:40.520 --> 04:42.760
The interplay of Yin and Yang
forms the Four Symbols,

04:42.840 --> 04:45.240
and the Shackle of Delicacy binds
even the spirits from all directions.

04:48.160 --> 04:50.200
It seems he is quite skilled.

04:53.680 --> 04:55.480
This Shackle of Delicacy is ever-changing.

04:55.560 --> 04:56.680
Moving forward,

04:57.320 --> 04:58.840
you must follow
my instructions step by step

04:58.920 --> 05:00.160
to escape the array.

05:00.760 --> 05:01.920
Step one.

05:02.880 --> 05:03.840
Earth generates Fire
in the second position,

05:04.600 --> 05:05.760
originating from the Vermilion Bird.

05:07.240 --> 05:09.080
South, Fire, Vermilion Bird…

05:09.960 --> 05:12.400
This array is based
on the Hetu and Luoshu.

05:12.480 --> 05:14.400
Judging from the Hetu
and star positions earlier,

05:15.360 --> 05:16.560
south…

05:16.640 --> 05:18.800
should be… this way.

05:24.360 --> 05:26.360
Earth generates Fire
in the second position,

05:27.600 --> 05:28.640
two.

05:32.280 --> 05:34.320
TWO

05:41.520 --> 05:42.920
Earth generates Fire
in the second position,

05:43.600 --> 05:44.920
and Heaven completes it in the seventh.

05:47.680 --> 05:49.280
Generating in the second
and completing in the seventh…

05:49.800 --> 05:51.040
Seven…

05:51.560 --> 05:53.480
It should be nearby.

06:01.880 --> 06:04.400
SEVEN

06:07.680 --> 06:08.960
Earth generates Metal
in the fourth position,

06:09.040 --> 06:10.280
originating from the White Tiger.

06:11.120 --> 06:12.360
West, Metal, White Tiger.

06:17.160 --> 06:18.480
FOUR

06:21.400 --> 06:22.880
Earth generates Metal
in the fourth position,

06:23.560 --> 06:25.120
and Heaven completes it in the ninth.

06:26.960 --> 06:29.800
NINE

06:47.480 --> 06:49.720
This person's origins are unknown.

06:50.240 --> 06:53.360
If he begins to doubt me
after breaking the array…

06:57.280 --> 06:58.200
Sir…

07:00.560 --> 07:02.240
Only one final step remains.

07:02.320 --> 07:03.440
Miss,

07:04.040 --> 07:06.440
are you perhaps thinking
of where to attack me?

07:11.760 --> 07:12.920
Yes!

07:13.000 --> 07:15.320
I was just about to cut your neck,

07:15.400 --> 07:17.160
so you wouldn't have to suffer anymore.

07:17.240 --> 07:19.440
I have no interest in meddling
in others' grievances

07:19.520 --> 07:21.840
or engaging in fights and killings.

07:22.360 --> 07:24.400
However, if I can unlock
the Shackle of Delicacy,

07:24.920 --> 07:27.040
I can naturally trap you back inside.

07:29.520 --> 07:31.480
Why are you just like my friend,

07:31.560 --> 07:33.720
unable to take a joke?

07:34.240 --> 07:37.960
Is the friend you mentioned
the Young Lord of Snow City,

07:38.720 --> 07:39.840
Xie Xuechen?

07:43.640 --> 07:44.840
The final step.

07:46.040 --> 07:47.480
Two and four are the shoulders,

07:47.560 --> 07:50.720
six and eight are the legs,
and five is the center.

07:51.240 --> 07:53.480
The Shackle of Delicacy will be broken.

07:56.240 --> 08:00.440
NAN XUYUE, MASTER OF GREENVIEW HEIGHTS

08:01.920 --> 08:05.000
Miss, please be careful,
and don't make any missteps.

08:12.880 --> 08:13.960
No, that's wrong.

08:14.920 --> 08:15.920
Five as the center…

08:19.800 --> 08:21.080
That doesn't mean looking for "five".

08:25.920 --> 08:26.880
Rather,

08:30.520 --> 08:32.000
it means retrieving "ten and five".

08:33.919 --> 08:35.799
Ten and five together form the center.

08:35.880 --> 08:37.480
It should be…

08:47.920 --> 08:50.400
TEN

09:32.240 --> 09:34.520
Miss Mu, you look so beautiful now!

09:40.200 --> 09:41.840
Who exactly are you,

09:41.920 --> 09:43.800
to break the array so effortlessly?

09:43.880 --> 09:46.840
I am Nan Xuyue of Greenview Heights.

09:47.480 --> 09:49.000
May I ask your name?

09:50.200 --> 09:51.120
Mu Xuanling.

09:51.760 --> 09:54.040
Is it the Mu meaning wood?

09:54.760 --> 09:56.480
The Mu meaning dusk.

10:10.560 --> 10:13.560
Mr. Nan, your carriage
seems ordinary from the outside,

10:13.640 --> 10:16.440
but I didn't expect it
to be so large inside.

10:18.280 --> 10:19.920
Using arrays to expand space…

10:20.000 --> 10:22.320
Mr. Nan, you're indeed
the foremost expert of arrays today.

10:22.960 --> 10:23.880
It's said that in our time,

10:23.960 --> 10:25.880
only two people were born
with an extra sense.

10:25.960 --> 10:28.880
One is Xie Xuechen,
the other is you, Mr. Nan.

10:29.520 --> 10:33.240
Your talent is extraordinary,
capable of divining the past and future.

10:35.040 --> 10:37.040
Even my mother once said,

10:38.120 --> 10:42.200
Mr. Nan is the smartest perso
n in the world.

10:42.280 --> 10:45.280
She also said nothing
can escape your notice.

10:45.360 --> 10:46.440
Is that true?

10:48.040 --> 10:50.120
That was all in the past.

10:50.640 --> 10:52.640
I've long lost my ability to foresee.

10:52.720 --> 10:56.040
So, now, in this world,
I know no more than anyone else.

10:57.920 --> 10:59.440
Then, how did you know

10:59.520 --> 11:01.880
it was Xie Xuechen
who trapped me in the Shackle of Delicacy?

11:03.960 --> 11:05.120
To be honest,

11:05.640 --> 11:06.840
the Shackle of Delicacy

11:06.920 --> 11:09.560
were created by Xuechen and me
in our youth.

11:10.160 --> 11:11.200
Thus, in this world,

11:11.280 --> 11:13.920
besides me,
he is the only one who knows it.

11:14.000 --> 11:16.280
You and Xie Xuechen are friends?

11:17.560 --> 11:21.040
For someone as aloof as him
to have a friend?

11:22.960 --> 11:26.080
Aren't you also friends with Xuechen?

11:27.200 --> 11:29.120
-Then, what you said earlier…
-Yes!

11:29.200 --> 11:32.000
He and I are, of course, friends.

11:34.120 --> 11:36.640
Xie Xuechen has faced great hardships.

11:36.720 --> 11:40.240
Though he was unkind to me,
I cannot abandon him.

11:40.320 --> 11:41.280
Why not…

11:41.360 --> 11:42.280
I understand.

11:43.200 --> 11:46.560
It's better to resolve the small
misunderstanding between friends,

11:46.640 --> 11:47.520
isn't it?

11:49.560 --> 11:50.480
If that's the case,

11:51.000 --> 11:53.000
you can come with me to Greenview Heights.

11:53.080 --> 11:54.880
By chance, Xuechen will also be there.

11:54.960 --> 11:57.720
You know Xie Xuechen
will be at Greenview Heights?

11:59.160 --> 12:02.320
Given his current situation,
he likely has no other choice.

12:02.400 --> 12:04.080
That's not hard to guess.

12:04.160 --> 12:06.520
It's just a matter of whether
you're willing to come along.

12:06.600 --> 12:07.520
That's exactly what I intend.

12:08.240 --> 12:09.920
I want to go too!

12:10.800 --> 12:11.800
Why would you go?

12:11.880 --> 12:13.600
You should go home
and stop worrying your mother.

12:14.880 --> 12:17.560
But I still need to repay the favor.

12:17.640 --> 12:18.480
Also,

12:18.560 --> 12:21.960
if I want to find my father,
I must learn some real skills.

12:22.040 --> 12:24.920
I want to follow you to train!

12:25.560 --> 12:26.600
You've already helped me,

12:26.680 --> 12:28.960
so let's not talk about favors anymore.

12:29.040 --> 12:31.200
If you want to learn skills,
I'm not the one to teach you.

12:31.280 --> 12:32.160
Besides,

12:32.240 --> 12:34.480
I have other things to do
and can't take you along.

12:35.080 --> 12:36.960
Miss Mu…

12:39.360 --> 12:40.600
Mr. Nan,

12:41.680 --> 12:44.320
may I…

12:44.400 --> 12:45.880
visit your home?

12:46.720 --> 12:49.640
I'm very well-behaved!
I won't cause trouble or steal food.

12:50.280 --> 12:53.400
Just give me a small place to stay.

12:53.920 --> 12:55.800
If there's no small place, it's fine.

12:55.880 --> 12:56.800
I'll…

12:56.880 --> 12:59.560
just find a hole and sleep there.

13:00.160 --> 13:01.120
How about it?

13:10.360 --> 13:11.760
Mr. Nan, don't look at me.

13:11.840 --> 13:13.400
I'm not responsible for her.

13:13.480 --> 13:15.800
Since she's asking you,
it's your decision to make.

13:19.360 --> 13:21.040
Then, let's invite Bao as my little guest.

13:21.640 --> 13:24.240
-What do you say?
-Great! Thank you, Mr. Nan!

13:26.240 --> 13:27.800
Miss Mu!

13:29.120 --> 13:31.640
Miss Mu!

13:32.920 --> 13:34.880
Miss Mu!

13:38.320 --> 13:40.880
Actually, I once cast a fortune.

13:42.160 --> 13:45.160
It foretold that today,
I would reunite with an old friend here.

13:46.600 --> 13:48.120
I've waited a long time,

13:49.440 --> 13:51.400
almost thinking I wouldn't see her.

14:01.560 --> 14:03.920
And now, have you seen her?

14:13.360 --> 14:15.480
MOONLIGHT HEIGHTS

14:17.240 --> 14:18.600
Sir, enjoy your meal.

14:23.840 --> 14:26.000
That's Nan Xuyue of Greenview Heights?

14:26.720 --> 14:28.680
I heard he was born with an extra sense

14:28.760 --> 14:30.720
but was ambushed,
destroying three of them.

14:30.800 --> 14:32.160
Now he's disabled.

14:32.240 --> 14:34.720
Yes, how pitiful.

14:34.800 --> 14:36.360
I see him sitting
in the courtyard day after day.

14:36.960 --> 14:38.520
Such a genius, fallen so low.

14:38.600 --> 14:39.720
How can he endure it?

14:40.680 --> 14:42.880
His father is seeking healers everywhere.

14:42.960 --> 14:44.680
Now he's turned to our master.

14:44.760 --> 14:48.080
But whether our master
will lend the Chaos Pearl to save him…

14:59.400 --> 15:03.440
Why are you sitting here,
not moving at all?

15:05.240 --> 15:06.760
I can no longer cultivate.

15:08.200 --> 15:09.560
And my legs are broken.

15:10.680 --> 15:12.000
I'm in a bad mood.

15:14.680 --> 15:18.280
But it doesn't seem like you're very sad.

15:18.360 --> 15:21.960
You just seem lonely and bored.

15:29.040 --> 15:30.840
I'll be your friend.

15:30.920 --> 15:32.040
How about it?

15:33.760 --> 15:37.320
I heard that liking someone is precious.

15:38.280 --> 15:41.000
If you share a little
of your candy with me,

15:41.080 --> 15:43.840
I'll share a little bit
of my liking with you.

15:45.400 --> 15:46.640
How about that?

16:03.200 --> 16:04.120
Here, one for you.

16:11.360 --> 16:12.640
Thank you!

16:28.760 --> 16:30.600
A whole plate of candy

16:31.360 --> 16:34.040
for just a tiny bit of liking…

16:37.280 --> 16:39.640
What a stingy little girl you are.

16:43.440 --> 16:44.440
I've seen her.

16:47.560 --> 16:49.560
But she's already forgotten me.

16:55.080 --> 16:56.960
Feng Yao, let's return.

16:57.480 --> 16:58.480
Yes, sir.

17:05.520 --> 17:10.440
GREENVIEW HEIGHTS

17:11.280 --> 17:15.359
GREENVIEW HEIGHTS

17:18.520 --> 17:19.680
Please wait here.

17:19.760 --> 17:22.119
He should arrive shortly.

17:23.240 --> 17:26.040
Miss Mu, this pastry is delicious!

17:26.119 --> 17:28.000
Try some! It's really good!

17:35.800 --> 17:36.880
Delicious.

17:37.680 --> 17:38.840
As long as you like it, miss.

17:42.840 --> 17:45.600
Mr. Nan, have you known
Xie Xuechen for long?

17:45.680 --> 17:47.160
About…

17:47.840 --> 17:48.960
Over ten years, I think.

17:49.760 --> 17:53.320
Then you must know a lot about him.

17:56.680 --> 17:59.080
That depends on which aspects you mean.

18:03.240 --> 18:05.280
Sir, Mr. Xie has arrived.

18:06.080 --> 18:07.480
Mr. Xie!

18:24.200 --> 18:27.000
Since you're here at my place now,
take off the hairpin.

18:33.560 --> 18:35.480
Turns out you're so handsome, Mr. Xie!

18:36.480 --> 18:39.000
It's been a long time
since our last meeting.

18:47.920 --> 18:50.920
Why does it feel like
you're not happy to see me?

18:54.400 --> 18:56.520
You seem happy to see me.

18:58.640 --> 18:59.680
But…

19:00.600 --> 19:01.640
why did you bring her here?

19:02.920 --> 19:03.760
Miss Mu said

19:05.000 --> 19:06.480
there's a misunderstanding
between you two.

19:07.200 --> 19:08.800
-Do you believe it?
-Of course not.

19:10.960 --> 19:12.440
You're still such a busybody as always.

19:23.000 --> 19:23.960
Why did you follow us here?

19:24.960 --> 19:25.960
Is there something you want to say?

19:27.680 --> 19:29.280
Indeed, there is.

19:37.280 --> 19:40.000
Xie Xuechen, you scoundrel!

19:46.280 --> 19:47.880
Miss Mu might still be angry.

19:47.960 --> 19:49.920
Now may not be the best time to talk.

19:50.000 --> 19:51.680
Why not rest first,

19:52.280 --> 19:53.920
then resolve the misunderstanding
when she's calmed down?

19:54.520 --> 19:55.400
What do you think?

20:02.200 --> 20:03.120
Bao.

20:03.200 --> 20:04.640
Miss Mu.

20:09.880 --> 20:11.120
Greenview Heights
truly lives up to its fame

20:11.200 --> 20:13.280
for mechanisms and arrays.

20:13.800 --> 20:17.120
The rocks and plants here
seem randomly placed,

20:17.200 --> 20:19.200
but they hide arrays everywhere.

20:19.720 --> 20:23.120
No wonder Mr. Nan feels confident
letting us wander freely.

20:23.640 --> 20:25.640
Feng Yao,

20:26.640 --> 20:30.560
if an enemy acted recklessly
here at Greenview Heights,

20:30.640 --> 20:32.120
would he die instantly?

20:32.200 --> 20:34.760
So, miss, please don't act rashly.

20:36.720 --> 20:37.800
What are you implying?

20:37.880 --> 20:39.320
I'm a good person!

20:39.840 --> 20:41.560
Do you know who she is?

20:42.880 --> 20:45.480
A Spirit Clan member with demonic powers.
There aren't many of them left.

20:45.560 --> 20:47.280
Given her age,

20:47.360 --> 20:48.680
I could probably guess.

20:48.760 --> 20:50.200
Since you guessed, why bring her here?

20:50.280 --> 20:52.560
Because you used the Shackle of Delicacy.

20:55.600 --> 20:56.640
Sit.

21:03.640 --> 21:07.240
Using blood as a sacrifice
to set a killing array isn't hard,

21:07.320 --> 21:09.440
but you chose to only trap her.

21:09.520 --> 21:11.120
That shows you didn't want to kill her.

21:11.640 --> 21:12.840
That's one reason.

21:13.360 --> 21:14.600
And the second reason?

21:15.600 --> 21:17.280
The second reason is Bao.

21:17.360 --> 21:18.960
She's naturally sensitive.

21:19.040 --> 21:21.720
She won't approach truly wicked people

21:21.800 --> 21:23.000
who carry the karma of murder.

21:23.800 --> 21:27.360
The fact that Bao likes Miss Mu so much
proves she isn't a bad person.

21:28.120 --> 21:29.840
You should know that too.

21:32.120 --> 21:33.040
Calm down.

21:37.480 --> 21:39.280
Since she's
the Saintess of the Dark Abyss,

21:39.360 --> 21:41.200
instead of letting her run
loose outside and cause trouble,

21:41.720 --> 21:43.800
it's better to keep her under your watch.

21:44.960 --> 21:46.040
That was the right decision.

21:47.040 --> 21:48.040
How about you?

21:48.560 --> 21:49.680
How's your body holding up?

21:51.840 --> 21:55.320
When I was trapped in the Lava,
she gave me a medicine to take.

21:55.400 --> 21:57.680
It temporarily restored
my spiritual power,

21:58.200 --> 21:59.400
but for the next ten days,

21:59.480 --> 22:01.600
I couldn't use any power at all.

22:02.560 --> 22:04.760
She told me about how she saved you,

22:05.680 --> 22:08.640
but I didn't expect
she'd use Half-Day Glory on you.

22:10.440 --> 22:13.080
Half helpful, half troublesome.

22:13.160 --> 22:14.240
Interesting.

22:15.160 --> 22:16.000
Interesting?

22:18.560 --> 22:19.640
Oops, I misspoke.

22:20.160 --> 22:22.360
What's so funny? Is there a remedy?

22:23.440 --> 22:26.920
With your Jade Vault Technique,
your healing ability is already superior.

22:27.000 --> 22:29.600
After ten days,
your full power will return.

22:30.120 --> 22:30.960
I can't wait that long.

22:36.440 --> 22:39.600
Is it because
the Dark Abyss is still moving?

22:45.680 --> 22:49.760
Ancient texts mention a method
of drawing runes with spirit ink.

22:49.840 --> 22:51.400
It can speed up
recovery of spiritual power.

22:52.000 --> 22:53.240
Want to try it?

22:53.760 --> 22:54.920
Yes.

22:55.480 --> 22:57.600
How long will it take to prepare
a teleportation array

22:57.680 --> 22:58.840
from Greenview Heights to Snow City?

23:01.040 --> 23:04.560
Spanning thousands of miles,
it's different from other arrays.

23:06.080 --> 23:06.920
It'll take a day to set up.

23:08.360 --> 23:09.800
A day? Alright.

23:11.280 --> 23:12.680
Let me borrow your paper crane
for communication first.

23:14.600 --> 23:15.880
Alliance Leader,

23:15.960 --> 23:17.080
Sang Qi has joined forces with a traitor
within the Immortal Alliance,

23:17.160 --> 23:18.160
planning to steal the Chaos Pearl.

23:18.680 --> 23:19.720
Please be cautious.

23:20.240 --> 23:21.080
I'll return as soon as I can.

23:24.040 --> 23:26.520
Earlier, I contacted
the Alliance's secret guards.

23:26.600 --> 23:27.440
TEMPLE OF DIVINE EXECUTION

23:27.520 --> 23:28.400
The five sects of the Immortal Alliance

23:28.480 --> 23:30.080
only know that Xie Xuechen
entered the Immortals Array

23:30.160 --> 23:31.280
and hasn't emerged since.

23:31.360 --> 23:32.800
They know nothing else.

23:32.880 --> 23:34.120
Xie Xuechen escaped,

23:34.200 --> 23:37.360
but he did not immediately return
to Snow City.

23:37.440 --> 23:39.040
That suggests two possibilities.

23:39.120 --> 23:40.000
The first possibility

23:40.080 --> 23:42.160
is that Xie Xuechen
suspects the five sects

23:42.240 --> 23:43.200
of the Immortal Alliance.

23:44.000 --> 23:46.120
He knows that the ambush
in the Immortals Array

23:46.200 --> 23:49.280
suggests a traitor within the five sects.

23:50.080 --> 23:51.520
The second possibility

23:51.600 --> 23:53.680
is that he hasn't yet recovered
his full strength,

23:54.480 --> 23:57.280
so he can't return to Snow City
thousands of miles away

23:58.000 --> 24:02.400
or even to contact the nearest sect.

24:04.400 --> 24:06.280
Given Xie Xuechen's character,

24:06.360 --> 24:08.120
if he had recovered his strength

24:08.200 --> 24:10.120
and confirmed there's
a traitor among the five sects,

24:10.200 --> 24:13.560
he'd immediately return to the sect
and wipe out the traitor.

24:14.080 --> 24:15.080
Therefore,

24:15.160 --> 24:19.080
it's very likely
he's still severely injured.

24:19.680 --> 24:21.880
Continue training your projection clones

24:22.400 --> 24:24.320
and locate their whereabouts.

24:24.400 --> 24:25.320
-Understood.
-Understood.

24:28.200 --> 24:31.600
Do you know who the traitor is
within the Immortal Alliance?

24:32.720 --> 24:33.800
Not yet.

24:34.920 --> 24:37.080
That's why I need
to return to Snow City soon,

24:37.160 --> 24:39.920
to uncover the traitor
and protect the Chaos Pearl.

24:41.960 --> 24:45.280
Did your journey
into the Dark Abyss reveal anything?

24:52.120 --> 24:54.800
Others may not know you, but I do.

24:54.880 --> 24:56.240
With your personality,

24:56.320 --> 24:59.400
you'd fight to the death
before getting captured.

25:01.160 --> 25:04.080
For you to be caught in the Dark Abyss,
there's only one explanation.

25:05.240 --> 25:06.400
You planned it.

25:09.640 --> 25:10.960
Six thousand years ago,

25:11.480 --> 25:13.280
the first Immortal Alliance
devoted all its power

25:13.360 --> 25:15.560
to set up the Immortals Array
on the Two Realms Mountain,

25:15.640 --> 25:17.400
stopping the Dark Clan's invasion.

25:18.280 --> 25:20.120
Since then, the Dark Clan
couldn't enter the human realm,

25:20.200 --> 25:23.040
and humans couldn't enter the Dark Abyss.

25:23.120 --> 25:25.320
No one knows what lies
within the Dark Abyss.

25:25.400 --> 25:27.960
Without understanding the enemy,
how can we hope to win?

25:30.400 --> 25:34.520
So, before you went to repair the barrier,
you had already made up your mind.

25:35.120 --> 25:38.480
If the repair succeeded,
you would retreat in glory.

25:38.560 --> 25:40.440
If it failed,

25:40.520 --> 25:42.960
you'd let them capture you

25:43.040 --> 25:44.760
to gather intelligence on the Dark Abyss.

25:45.520 --> 25:46.400
Am I right?

25:55.960 --> 25:58.600
That's why you released
those Ice Fireflies

25:58.680 --> 26:01.400
that only live a day but can send images.

26:01.480 --> 26:03.240
Those little fireflies are impressive.

26:03.760 --> 26:05.920
They even managed
to gather intelligence on Sang Qi.

26:06.480 --> 26:07.800
It's precisely
because they spotted Sang Qi…

26:07.880 --> 26:08.720
TEMPLE OF DIVINE EXECUTION

26:08.800 --> 26:10.520
…that something seems off.

26:10.600 --> 26:11.440
Why?

26:12.040 --> 26:13.920
Sang Qi's power is remarkable.

26:14.000 --> 26:15.080
Even if he's injured,

26:15.160 --> 26:17.600
he would have noticed
that the fireflies were spying on him.

26:17.680 --> 26:20.280
Unless Sang Qi is pretending.

26:20.360 --> 26:21.880
He wants others to believe

26:21.960 --> 26:23.840
he's gravely injured.

26:24.720 --> 26:25.560
But why?

26:25.640 --> 26:27.120
Because his true intentions
remain unclear,

26:27.200 --> 26:28.920
I went to the Temple of Divine Execution

26:29.000 --> 26:30.680
as soon as my spiritual power returned.

26:31.320 --> 26:32.560
If speculation doesn't work,

26:33.080 --> 26:36.200
capturing and killing him directly
is the best solution.

26:37.160 --> 26:38.280
It's a pity

26:39.400 --> 26:41.640
I miscalculated
the effects of Half-Day Glory.

26:42.160 --> 26:44.320
I didn't expect my spiritual power
to only last for an hour.

26:45.000 --> 26:46.240
Xie Xuechen,

26:47.600 --> 26:50.240
did you realize
you were gambling with your life?

26:51.120 --> 26:52.480
What if you had died in the Dark Abyss?

26:52.560 --> 26:54.120
Then it would've just been a life lost.

26:55.440 --> 26:57.520
At least the Immortals Array
has been repaired.

27:03.600 --> 27:07.000
"The path of a sword cultivator
isn't one that lasts long."

27:08.080 --> 27:09.680
Now, I believe this saying.

27:11.200 --> 27:12.240
Xuyue,

27:13.760 --> 27:15.840
there's something else I find odd.

27:17.000 --> 27:19.200
How did Sang Qi
obtain the Illusion Elixir?

27:20.880 --> 27:21.720
The Illusion Elixir?

27:23.360 --> 27:25.760
Six thousand years ago,
when Phoenix Mountain collapsed,

27:25.840 --> 27:29.440
the Phoenix Herb necessary for the elixir
was wiped out overnight.

27:29.520 --> 27:31.840
How could anyone
still make the Illusion Elixir?

27:33.440 --> 27:34.480
Xuyue,

27:35.640 --> 27:37.000
I have a faint feeling

27:38.240 --> 27:41.000
that the crack in the Immortals Array
is just the beginning.

27:41.520 --> 27:42.640
Behind all this,

27:43.720 --> 27:46.200
someone is planning a grand scheme.

27:48.640 --> 27:50.800
With so many unanswered mysteries,

27:51.400 --> 27:55.160
have you considered
using Miss Mu to uncover the truth?

28:04.400 --> 28:05.640
I have.

28:07.200 --> 28:08.720
I guessed it.

28:09.560 --> 28:11.120
If you didn't want to,

28:11.200 --> 28:13.040
how could she have
possibly threatened you?

28:13.640 --> 28:16.880
It's because you want to figure out
what kind of person she is,

28:16.960 --> 28:20.440
what her true intentions are,
and why she's so obsessed with you.

28:20.520 --> 28:21.560
Am I right?

28:21.640 --> 28:22.480
Yes.

28:22.560 --> 28:25.480
I even thought about using her
to deal with the Dark Abyss and Sang Qi.

28:25.560 --> 28:26.840
But then you trapped her
in the Shackle of Delicacy

28:27.840 --> 28:29.720
and chose to part ways with her.

28:30.240 --> 28:31.080
Did you change your mind?

28:31.680 --> 28:35.320
Using a woman to investigate
goes against my faith.

28:36.040 --> 28:38.680
Besides, she's a clever person.

28:39.800 --> 28:41.840
If I use her to investigate
Sang Qi and the Dark Abyss,

28:42.360 --> 28:44.280
she'll use me to spy
on the Immortal Alliance too.

28:44.800 --> 28:47.720
Who benefits more remains to be seen.

28:49.280 --> 28:52.080
Yet earlier,
you still went back to find her,

28:52.960 --> 28:54.000
didn't you?

28:56.160 --> 28:57.880
You trapped her in the Shackle of Delicacy

28:57.960 --> 29:00.000
and then headed here first.

29:00.080 --> 29:01.840
Logically,
you should've arrived before her,

29:02.440 --> 29:03.560
but you arrived late.

29:04.400 --> 29:06.920
And seeing her here,
you weren't surprised at all.

29:07.520 --> 29:10.200
You just asked why I brought her here.

29:10.720 --> 29:12.120
That means you already went back

29:12.200 --> 29:14.200
and knew that I had unlocked
the Shackle of Delicacy,

29:15.680 --> 29:16.680
right?

29:21.320 --> 29:22.360
The Spirit Detector is still glowing.

29:22.440 --> 29:24.640
There must be a Spirit Clan member
nearby. Check carefully!

29:24.720 --> 29:25.600
Understood!

29:25.680 --> 29:26.600
Look in those bushes over there!

29:26.680 --> 29:27.520
The Spirit Management Bureau…

29:27.600 --> 29:29.520
My mother said that if you go there,

29:29.600 --> 29:31.640
they'll put a Spirit Lock on you,

29:32.480 --> 29:35.920
enslaving you under human control
for the rest of your life.

29:36.000 --> 29:38.240
But if you don't register with them,

29:38.320 --> 29:40.280
you won't be recognized as a good demon.

29:40.880 --> 29:42.160
And regardless
of whether you're good or evil,

29:42.240 --> 29:43.400
others can kill you without consequence.

29:45.160 --> 29:46.640
Mu Xuanling is a Spirit Clan member.

30:15.480 --> 30:17.120
Could it have been Xuyue who saved her?

30:18.800 --> 30:19.920
Xuyue…

30:27.040 --> 30:28.160
Xuyue,

30:29.120 --> 30:30.840
she said she wants to turn over a new leaf

30:30.920 --> 30:32.280
and start fresh.

30:32.360 --> 30:33.400
Do you believe her?

30:33.480 --> 30:36.720
You neither dare to trust her
nor have the heart to kill her.

30:36.800 --> 30:38.520
Then, do as you think best.

30:38.600 --> 30:41.120
Find out for yourself
what kind of person she really is

30:41.200 --> 30:42.800
and what she truly intends to do.

30:48.200 --> 30:49.320
Bao.

30:49.400 --> 30:53.000
As for me,
I have important matters to attend to.

30:53.080 --> 30:54.360
The road ahead won't be safe,

30:54.960 --> 30:57.280
and the cultivation techniques I practice
aren't ones you can learn.

30:57.360 --> 31:00.520
Once Xie Xuechen and I leave,
you should head home too.

31:01.760 --> 31:03.840
If you're determined to find your father,

31:03.920 --> 31:05.480
you can ask Nan Xuyue to help you.

31:05.560 --> 31:06.800
It's the same, isn't it?

31:06.880 --> 31:10.400
But I like you,
and I want to stay with you.

31:21.760 --> 31:24.160
Looks like I need to tell you the truth.

31:25.520 --> 31:28.840
I'm a villain from the Dark Abyss,

31:28.920 --> 31:31.680
specializing in eating little beasts
like you that wander alone.

31:31.760 --> 31:34.640
Fried, stir-fried, steamed, boiled,
grilled, or roasted…

31:34.720 --> 31:35.800
There are countless ways

31:36.320 --> 31:37.440
to cook you!

31:38.680 --> 31:41.640
I know you're not bad.

31:41.720 --> 31:42.960
I can feel it.

31:43.040 --> 31:45.640
Besides, you have treasures on you.

31:46.160 --> 31:47.840
I can absorb

31:48.880 --> 31:50.240
their aura to cultivate.

31:50.320 --> 31:52.200
It won't take up your time to teach me.

31:55.840 --> 31:57.320
Don't think this will make me agree.

31:57.960 --> 32:00.920
After Greenview Heights, let's part ways.

32:02.160 --> 32:04.040
Mr. Xie told you not to follow him,

32:04.120 --> 32:05.320
but you didn't listen either.

32:06.600 --> 32:07.440
I…

32:08.200 --> 32:11.080
You're so young,
yet your tongue is quite sharp.

32:13.040 --> 32:13.880
Miss Mu,

32:13.960 --> 32:16.000
you're clearly mad at Mr. Xie,

32:16.080 --> 32:18.920
so why are you looking for him?

32:19.000 --> 32:21.040
Is it for revenge?

32:22.480 --> 32:24.520
I've spoiled him too much before.

32:24.600 --> 32:27.240
When I get the chance,
I'll definitely make him…

32:28.120 --> 32:29.720
like this… and like that…

32:30.720 --> 32:32.240
What exactly is "this and that"?

32:33.080 --> 32:35.440
Kid, don't ask too many questions.

32:39.560 --> 32:41.680
Actually, Xie Xuechen isn't bad.

32:41.760 --> 32:44.040
But after all, we're on
opposite sides, good and evil.

32:44.560 --> 32:46.400
I keep bothering him.

32:47.520 --> 32:49.680
So, for someone
as aloof and upright as he is,

32:49.760 --> 32:52.480
it's normal for him
to not accept it at first.

32:53.880 --> 32:54.760
Miss Mu,

32:55.880 --> 32:57.760
what you're saying sounds so familiar.

32:58.280 --> 33:01.680
It's just like how my mother
complains about my father

33:01.760 --> 33:03.640
never coming back.

33:03.720 --> 33:06.200
And then later, she'd explain, saying,

33:06.280 --> 33:07.800
"Your father

33:07.880 --> 33:11.240
must've run into some trouble
and can't come back for now."

33:15.400 --> 33:18.000
Miss Mu, you said
back in the Shackle of Delicacy

33:18.080 --> 33:21.640
that you had something very important
that you didn't tell Mr. Xie.

33:21.720 --> 33:22.680
What is it?

33:26.240 --> 33:27.240
Bao,

33:27.840 --> 33:29.000
let me ask you a question.

33:30.680 --> 33:34.680
Do you believe in coming back to life?

33:34.760 --> 33:35.880
My mother says,

33:37.080 --> 33:39.920
except for the Dark Clan, who don't die,

33:40.000 --> 33:42.560
Spirits and Humans
are simply dead when they die.

33:48.080 --> 33:49.920
Dead is dead?

33:50.880 --> 33:53.200
To come back to life,

33:53.280 --> 33:55.560
it would take a miracle.

33:58.160 --> 34:00.560
But the Divine Clan
abandoned Humans long ago.

34:00.640 --> 34:02.120
Even the Celestial Ladder is closed.

34:02.640 --> 34:04.560
There hasn't been a Deity
in the world for thousands of years.

34:05.080 --> 34:06.280
So, where would a miracle come from?

34:07.960 --> 34:10.800
That's why my mother says

34:11.320 --> 34:14.280
to protect your own life

34:14.360 --> 34:16.760
because you only get one.

34:18.880 --> 34:21.040
It's not shameful to be a coward
if it keeps you alive.

34:35.639 --> 34:36.920
Your swordsmanship is powerful.

34:37.000 --> 34:38.120
Your array mastery is powerful.

34:38.199 --> 34:39.320
POWERFUL ARRAY MASTERY
AND POWERFUL SKILLS TO ANNOY OTHERS

34:39.400 --> 34:41.199
Your skills to annoy others
is powerful too.

35:14.520 --> 35:15.560
Seems like it went smoothly.

35:18.720 --> 35:22.040
The Half-Day Glory
leaves you powerless for ten days.

35:22.760 --> 35:24.920
Only after those ten days
will you start to regain power.

35:25.000 --> 35:26.640
But these runes work differently.

35:26.720 --> 35:29.920
Starting now, you'll recover
a little power each day.

35:30.000 --> 35:32.280
If you maintain proper meditation,

35:32.360 --> 35:34.360
you'll regain full strength in five days.

35:36.000 --> 35:37.080
Xuyue,

35:38.600 --> 35:39.520
thank you.

35:41.600 --> 35:42.640
No need to thank me.

35:43.880 --> 35:46.440
Just take better care of your life,
and I'll be satisfied.

35:47.640 --> 35:49.280
Sir, something's happened!

35:57.680 --> 35:59.000
Miss Gao, what's up?

35:59.080 --> 36:01.840
Mr. Nan, we've encountered…

36:03.760 --> 36:05.560
Mr. Xie…

36:07.920 --> 36:09.360
The Mirage Palace received word

36:09.440 --> 36:12.960
that you repaired the Immortals Array
but have yet to return.

36:13.040 --> 36:14.520
I specifically
brought people to look for you,

36:15.400 --> 36:17.120
and here you are.

36:17.200 --> 36:19.760
Mr. Xie, are you well?

36:21.320 --> 36:23.000
We'll discuss my matters later.

36:24.000 --> 36:25.760
Did something happen to you?

36:25.840 --> 36:27.320
My fellow disciples and I

36:27.400 --> 36:29.800
were attacked by demonic cultivators
at a nearby staging post.

36:29.880 --> 36:31.800
We barely escaped,

36:31.880 --> 36:33.560
but on our way back to the Mirage Palace,

36:33.640 --> 36:34.920
we were ambushed again.

36:35.440 --> 36:37.560
It must've been those
demonic cultivators' allies.

36:39.400 --> 36:42.440
Mr. Nan, two
of my junior brothers are dead,

36:42.520 --> 36:45.160
and I was separated from my junior sister.

36:46.000 --> 36:48.680
I remembered Greenview Heights was nearby,

36:48.760 --> 36:49.960
so I came seeking aid.

36:50.480 --> 36:53.800
Mr. Nan, could you send someone
to rescue my junior sister, Cui Wanwan?

36:54.400 --> 36:55.600
Rest assured, Miss Gao.

37:02.480 --> 37:04.520
It's fortuitous that Mr. Xie is here.

37:04.600 --> 37:06.760
My master has a message for you.

37:08.880 --> 37:10.400
Shall we go somewhere private to talk?

37:10.480 --> 37:11.960
-Alright.
-No need!

37:13.840 --> 37:16.640
Miss Gao is already injured
and should not move around.

37:17.720 --> 37:18.760
You can speak here instead.

37:18.840 --> 37:21.000
I'll go prepare a room for you, Miss Gao.

37:35.440 --> 37:38.760
What message did your master leave for me?

37:39.360 --> 37:41.800
My master said
that over the past 6,000 years,

37:42.320 --> 37:45.200
the Immortals Array
has developed cracks multiple times.

37:45.280 --> 37:46.360
Repairing the barrier

37:46.440 --> 37:48.440
is the responsibility
of successive Alliance Leaders.

37:48.520 --> 37:50.720
This time, since
Alliance Leader Xie is in seclusion,

37:50.800 --> 37:53.000
the task fell
to the strongest in the Alliance.

37:53.080 --> 37:55.320
You, Mr. Xie.

37:55.840 --> 37:59.240
Not only are you the most capable,
but your sense of duty is unmatched.

38:00.160 --> 38:02.080
If you were to succeed
the position of Alliance Leader,

38:02.160 --> 38:04.440
the Immortal Alliance
would thrive even further.

38:04.960 --> 38:07.800
So, someone like you…

38:08.320 --> 38:10.280
if not dealt with early,

38:10.360 --> 38:11.600
will inevitably become a major threat!

38:25.800 --> 38:29.280
Being squeezed into such a small body
is really uncomfortable!

38:29.360 --> 38:31.840
The protective barrier
of Greenview Heights is quite impressive.

38:31.920 --> 38:34.680
If not for this method,
I wouldn't have been able to get in!

38:36.280 --> 38:38.880
Xie Xuechen, it's been two days,

38:38.960 --> 38:41.080
and I still want to kill you just as much.

38:42.160 --> 38:43.360
You think you can?

38:53.080 --> 38:56.480
Miss Mu!
I feel something scary has entered!

39:00.160 --> 39:01.920
Stay inside the room. Don't go out.

39:03.320 --> 39:05.480
You killed Desire Demon, didn't you?

39:06.160 --> 39:09.800
Alright then, let me take your head back

39:10.720 --> 39:13.040
to calm her down!

39:57.320 --> 39:58.680
You shouldn't have come here.

40:00.960 --> 40:02.600
What, are you afraid I'll die?

40:08.440 --> 40:10.440
Could you not flirt in front of me?

40:14.600 --> 40:16.600
Anger Demon, listen to me.

40:16.680 --> 40:19.360
What happened before isn't what you think.

40:19.440 --> 40:21.400
-I…
-I'm not listening!

40:23.480 --> 40:24.960
Before I came,

40:25.040 --> 40:27.080
Desire Demon and Ignorance Demon
warned me about you.

40:27.160 --> 40:31.040
They said you're the most
two-faced and deceitful person,

40:31.640 --> 40:33.480
and I shouldn't believe a word you say!

40:34.600 --> 40:35.680
That's not true!

40:35.760 --> 40:37.040
Don't listen to their nonsense.

40:37.120 --> 40:39.800
My character
is the most genuine and trustworthy.

40:49.200 --> 40:50.480
Your spiritual power hasn't recovered yet.

40:50.560 --> 40:51.720
I'll try to hold him off.

40:51.800 --> 40:52.720
You should run first.

40:54.800 --> 40:58.400
I hate it the most when people
whisper in front of me!

41:08.760 --> 41:10.200
Ah!
